 "stem": "Find the general term of the sequence $\\{a_n\\}$ determined by $a_1 = {=a1}, \\ a_{n+1} = {=p}a_n + {=q}$. Write $a_n$ in terms of $n$.",
 "solution": [
  "Solve $c = ({=p})c + {=q}$: $c = {=c}$.",
  "Then $a_{n+1} - {=c} = ({=p})(a_n - {=c})$, so $b_n = a_n - {=c}$ is a geometric sequence with ratio ${=p}$.",
  "$b_1 = a_1 - {=c} = {=d}$, so $b_n = {=d}\\times({=p})^{n-1}$.",
  "$a_n = b_n + {=c} = {=d}\\times({=p})^{n-1} + {=c}$."
 ],
